":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-b2a87abaad335c927721","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-06f1f28083cdd4e2dd27","layer":"original","quote":"术以夔彼郡人，欲胁令说蕲阳","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":205,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":42,"end":55,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-b47b400f7bed5ee445f2","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-f9ef22c8ffa2e60b9af1","layer":"original","quote":"夔言于太祖曰：“自军兴以来，制度草创，用人未详其本；是以各引其类，时忘道德。夔闻以贤制爵〖7〗，则民慎德；以庸制禄〖8〗，则民兴功。以为自今所用，必先核之乡闾，使长幼顺叙，无相逾越。显忠直之赏，明公实之报〖9〗，则贤、不肖之分，居然别矣〖10〗。又可修保举故不以实之令〖11〗，使有司别受其负〖12〗。在朝之臣，时受教与曹并选者〖13〗，各任其责。上以观朝臣之节，下以塞争竞之源；以督群下，以率万民。如是则天下幸甚","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":227,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":63,"end":270,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-b79c4106d12a1087fa41","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-8e9331a27b1a582299ff","layer":"original","quote":"乃遣郡丞黄珍往，为陈成败；承等皆请服","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":215,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":161,"end":179,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-cb39c93b758cb0019919","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-06f1f28083cdd4e2dd27","layer":"original","quote":"夔谓术谋臣李业曰：“昔柳下惠闻伐国之谋而有忧色〖2〗，曰：‘吾闻伐国不问仁人，斯言何为至于我哉！’”遂遁匿潜山。术知夔终不为己用，乃止","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":205,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":56,"end":123,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-cda31f531eb940a5faea","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-06f1f28083cdd4e2dd27","layer":"original","quote":"后袁术至寿春，辟之；夔不应，然遂为术所留","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":205,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-cdaa5a7cbb379ce4e35d","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-2818655e956292e2342d","layer":"original","quote":"特命二傅与尚书、东曹，并选太子、诸侯官属","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":228,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":22,"end":42,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-cf524ce327d8aef24418","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-8278f91af626ea7bc9be","layer":"original","quote":"夔常蓄毒药，誓死无辱，是以终不见及","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":214,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":149,"end":166,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-d613c7e6b71079cdcc55","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-8e9331a27b1a582299ff","layer":"original","quote":"议者欲举兵攻之。夔曰：“承等非生而乐乱也：习于乱，不能自还〖3〗；未被德教，故不知反善〖4〗。今兵迫之急，彼恐夷灭，必并力战；攻之既未易拔，虽胜必伤吏民。不如徐喻以恩德，使容自悔，可不烦兵而定","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":215,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":63,"end":159,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-d67a392c8f957686777f","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-f9ef22c8ffa2e60b9af1","layer":"original","quote":"太祖称善","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":227,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":272,"end":276,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-dcf560b84a0dc69a104b","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-2818655e956292e2342d","layer":"original","quote":"太子欲与辞，宿戒供〖16〗；夔无往意，乃与书请之；夔以国有常制，遂不往","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":228,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":86,"end":121,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-e1b4ef7696e8c5bb3c3e","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-12ec9479cee2fb4b3c56","layer":"pei","quote":"夔曰：‘为不义，适足害其身，焉能害人？且怀奸佞之心，立于明朝，其得久乎","attribution":"裴注·《魏书》","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":255,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-cdde0917d9029a309b9c","start":62,"end":97,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-e9dfdba63699d49e135d","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-8e9331a27b1a582299ff","layer":"original","quote":"东牟人王营，众三千余家，胁昌阳县为乱","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":215,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":230,"end":248,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-ea6f3df6a4eeb8294365","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-f9ef22c8ffa2e60b9af1","layer":"original","quote":"海贼郭祖寇暴乐安、济南界，州郡苦之","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":227,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":9,"end":26,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-f74dc7d921fd36e67a47","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-17f2c5893c0f9cd350ee","layer":"original","quote":"乃上言曰：“自丧乱以来，民人失所；今虽小安，然服教日浅。所下新科，皆以明罚敕法，齐一大化也。所领六县，疆域初定，加以饥馑；若一切齐以科禁〖4〗，恐或有不从教者。有不从教者不得不诛，则非观民设教随时之意也。先王辨九服之赋以殊远近〖5〗，制三典之刑以平治乱〖6〗；愚以为此郡宜依远域新邦之典。其民间小事，使长吏临时随宜；上不背正法，下以顺百姓之心。比及三年，民安其业；然后齐之以法，则无所不至矣","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":226,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":49,"end":244,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-f8bfdfb8d835fbbbeb28","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-8e9331a27b1a582299ff","layer":"original","quote":"夔遣吏王钦等，授以计略，使离散之：旬月皆平定","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":215,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":252,"end":274,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-fd3a5ab6ed4c66c401c0","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-4c0e7277bc46679144db","layer":"original","quote":"疾病，屡乞逊位。诏报曰：“盖礼贤亲旧〖18〗，帝王之常务也。以亲则君有辅弼之勋焉，以贤则君有醇固之茂焉〖19〗。夫有阴德者必有阳报〖20〗，今君疾虽未瘳，神明听之矣〖21〗。君其即安，以顺朕意","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":229,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":16,"end":112,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-fdc8b26800a9899b1812","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-b82d6a77fe5526953d88","layer":"original","quote":"避乱淮南","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":204,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":64,"end":68,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q2-b2740e413c35f3e37c11","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-8e9331a27b1a582299ff","layer":"original","quote":"出为城父令〖1〗。﹝二﹞迁长广太守〖2〗。郡滨山海，黄巾未平；豪杰多背叛，袁谭就加以官位。长广县人管承，徒众三千余家，为寇害。议者欲举兵攻之。夔曰：“承等非生而乐乱也：习于乱，不能自还〖3〗；未被德教，故不知反善〖4〗。今兵迫之急，彼恐夷灭，必并力战；攻之既未易拔，虽胜必伤吏民。不如徐喻以恩德，使容自悔，可不烦兵而定。”乃遣郡丞黄珍往，为陈成败；承等皆请服。夔遣吏成弘领校尉、长广县丞等郊迎〖5〗，奉牛酒，诣郡。牟平贼从钱，众亦数千；夔率郡兵与张辽共讨定之。东牟人王营，众三千余家，胁昌阳县为乱〖6〗；夔遣吏王钦等，授以计略，使离散之：旬月皆平定。","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":215,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":275,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q2-b707dd8f3386ddb2eef9","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-2818655e956292e2342d","layer":"original","quote":"文帝为太子，以凉茂为太傅，夔为少傅〖14〗。特命二傅与尚书、东曹，并选太子、诸侯官属。茂卒，以夔代茂。每月朔，太傅入见太子，太子正法服而礼焉〖15〗；他日无会仪。夔迁太仆，太子欲与辞，宿戒供〖16〗；夔无往意，乃与书请之；夔以国有常制，遂不往：其履正如此。然于节俭之世，最为豪汰〖17〗。","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":228,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":144,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q2-c98cefcbc6c88463b3c9","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-8278f91af626ea7bc9be","layer":"original","quote":"顷之，太祖辟为司空掾属。时有传袁术军乱者，太祖问夔曰：“君以为信不？”夔对曰：“天之所助者顺，人之所助者信。术无信顺之实，而望天人之助，此不可以得志于天下。夫失道之主，亲戚叛之，而况于左右乎？以夔观之，其乱必矣！”太祖曰：“为国失贤则亡，君不为术所用；乱，不亦宜乎！”太祖性严，掾属公事，往往加杖。夔常蓄毒药，誓死无辱，是以终不见及。﹝一﹞","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":214,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":170,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q2-edd1b044bf10d0c5e85f","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-f9ef22c8ffa2e60b9af1","layer":"original","quote":"征还，参丞相军事。海贼郭祖寇暴乐安、济南界，州郡苦之。太祖以夔前在长广有威信，拜乐安太守。到官数月，诸城悉平。入为丞相东曹掾。夔言于太祖曰：“自军兴以来，制度草创，用人未详其本；是以各引其类，时忘道德。夔闻以贤制爵〖7〗，则民慎德；以庸制禄〖8〗，则民兴功。以为自今所用，必先核之乡闾，使长幼顺叙，无相逾越。显忠直之赏，明公实之报〖9〗，则贤、不肖之分，居然别矣〖10〗。又可修保举故不以实之令〖11〗，使有司别受其负〖12〗。在朝之臣，时受教与曹并选者〖13〗，各任其责。上以观朝臣之节，下以塞争竞之源；以督群下，以率万民。如是则天下幸甚！”太祖称善。魏国既建，拜尚书仆射。﹝一﹞","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":227,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":291,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-p115a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-d31f474fc7e57ab9555e","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《魏氏春秋》曰：“以荀攸为尚书令；凉茂为仆射；毛玠、崔琰、常林、徐奕、何夔为尚书；王粲、杜袭、卫觊、和洽为侍中。”","attribution":"《魏氏春秋》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":279,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-efecfa99851d5aa2b4e2","start":0,"end":60,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-b9d79988a2b2559f2bb5","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-b9d79988a2b2559f2bb5","layer":"modern","quote":"〖11〗十八年：建安十八年（公元 213）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":137,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-bec99dfe67d67ae54b06","start":0,"end":22,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o139","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-d44820525c4645832365","layer":"original","quote":"十八年春正月〖11〗，进军濡须口〖12〗；攻破权江西营，获权都督公孙阳〖13〗，乃引军还。诏书并十四州〖14〗，复为九州〖15〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":107,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":65,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-p115","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-d31f474fc7e57ab9555e","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《魏氏春秋》曰：“以荀攸为尚书令；凉茂为仆射；毛玠、崔琰、常林、徐奕、何夔为尚书；王粲、杜袭、卫觊、和洽为侍中。”","attribution":"《魏氏春秋》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":279,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-efecfa99851d5aa2b4e2","start":0,"end":60,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-10be07fab250e72154b6","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-d6aa061a701fe673d612","layer":"original","quote":"甚见敬礼〖12〗。卒官","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":115,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":85,"end":96,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
